config SND_HDA_INTEL
    tristate "Intel/AMD High Definition Audio"
    depends on SND
    default y
    help
      Native PCI HDA controller, codec, PCM and mixer driver. The sound core
      retains provider code for open files and mappings. With M, build hda.ko
      for this ReliefNT kernel; an absent controller leaves it unbound.
